  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut eggplant (see ingredients) into bite-sized chunks.\n• Thinly slice capsicum.\n• Place eggplant and capsicum on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil (1 tbsp per person), season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Spread out evenly, then roast until edges are just starting to brown, 10 minutes.\n• TIP: Adding enough oil will ensure the eggplant softens in time.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a448818bcb653703ca99ffd/step-b645da00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop coriander stalks, reserving leaves to garnish.\n• Zest lemon to get a pinch, then slice into wedges.\n• In a large baking dish, combine diced tomatoes with garlic & onion (see ingredients), coriander stalks, lemon zest, chermoula spice blend and the water. Add the sugar and a drizzle of olive oil, then season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a448818bcb653703ca99ffd/step-6da1e510.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer roast veggies to the baking dish with the sauce, then stir to combine.\n• Place block of smooth fetta in the centre of baking dish.\n• Bake until fetta is soft and lightly golden, 15-20 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a448818bcb653703ca99ffd/step-7d8b7720.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When shakshuka has 5 minutes remaining, drizzle or brush flatbreads with olive oil. Place directly onto oven rack and bake until golden around the edges, 2-3 minutes.\n• Divide shakshuka-style fetta and eggplant bake between bowls. Tear over coriander leaves.\n• Tear flatbreads and serve with lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a448818bcb653703ca99ffd/step-ffcffe30.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
